WEBVTT

00:01:32.810 --> 00:01:34.780
<i>The Great Kanto Desert.</i>

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:38.950
<i>To assert their existence
in this harsh environment,</i>

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:42.920
<i>the meager creatures here love
each other and eventually bond,</i>

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:46.010
<i>thereby linking the lights of their lives.</i>

00:01:46.010 --> 00:01:48.790
<i>However!</i>

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:54.070
<i>Sometimes great sin occurs
during the pursuits of life!</i>

00:01:54.070 --> 00:01:59.680
<i>And the perpetrators of these crimes
always receive punishment!</i>

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:09.310
<i>This is the 10-day ordeal of a
certain person who lives in the same way</i>

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:12.340
<i>and was punished for his sinful crimes.</i>

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:18.750
<i>"Day 1"</i>

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:21.620
<i>See you in ten years!</i>

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:26.390
Now, then!

00:02:26.390 --> 00:02:28.390
<i>W-w-what?!</i>

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:30.930
Come on! Get the lead out!

00:02:30.930 --> 00:02:32.670
<i>Stop!</i>

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:37.740
<i>I really don't think we should
keep her alive, Master!</i>

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:40.840
Nah, I can use her
for all sorts of stuff!

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:42.660
<i>Use?</i>

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:44.440
Hey, Kosuna.

00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:45.930
<i>Y-yes?</i>

00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:53.120
You can go now. I'll take care
of this traitor myself.

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:54.220
Thanks for the help.

00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:56.890
<i>Take care of me, how?!</i>

00:02:56.890 --> 00:03:00.810
<i>Right. See you later...</i>

00:03:00.810 --> 00:03:01.970
Alright...

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:04.560
<i>What does "take care of" mean?!</i>

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:08.530
<i>If you're gonna kill me,
just get it over with!</i>

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:10.300
I ain't gonna kill ya.

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:11.510
<i>T-then!</i>

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:15.840
<i>- Whaaa?!</i>

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:15.840
- Round and round you go!

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:19.140
Now you got no sense of direction! Spin!

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:23.340
<i>Where are we?</i>

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:26.650
<i>What is this place?</i>

00:03:27.990 --> 00:03:31.930
I call it the "Sunabouzu Secret Base"!

00:03:31.930 --> 00:03:34.300
<i>Secret... base?!</i>

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:36.270
Cool, huh?!

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:40.610
It was in great condition
when I unearthed it five years ago

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:43.180
so I remodeled it for myself!

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:46.170
I haven't told anyone about it yet...

00:03:46.170 --> 00:03:51.180
...and I always hope you
would be my very first visitor!

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:52.710
<i>I see.</i>

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:57.400
But it IS a secret,
so I'm sorry about the blindfold!

00:03:58.520 --> 00:03:59.690
But...

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:01.820
...isn't it perfect to keep you in!

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:03.120
<i>K-keep?!</i>

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:06.740
Well, I gotta leave to finish
some last-minute work.

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:10.470
There's water and food in the back,
so make yourself at home!

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:14.750
<i>What's his deal?!</i>

00:04:33.990 --> 00:04:38.260
<i>He said he was going to
"take care of the traitor",</i>

00:04:38.260 --> 00:04:42.030
<i>but I get the feeling
he's actually crazy for me!</i>

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:46.330
<i>Well, I guess I'll take it easy
for a little while!</i>

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:50.030
<i>Knowing him, I'll be able
to escape anytime I want!</i>

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:53.910
<i>Oh, where's the bathroom?</i>

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:55.340
<i>Let's see...</i>

00:04:55.340 --> 00:04:56.620
<i>Hmm?</i>

00:04:57.680 --> 00:04:58.590
<i>"Day 2"</i>

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:05.380
<i>Why's it so hot?!
Doesn't he have air conditioning?!</i>

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:14.320
<i>It's so hot...</i>

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:21.390
<i>"Day 3"</i>

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:25.120
<i>I'm done for...</i>

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:32.330
<i>Don't tell me he's waiting for me
to sweat to death in here?!</i>

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:34.810
<i>Hey! Can anyone hear me?!</i>

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:37.080
<i>Lemme out! Lemme out of here!</i>

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:38.680
<i>Come on!</i>

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:45.550
<i>Seriously! I can't die
like a dog in here!</i>

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:57.240
<i>T-this is.</i>

00:06:01.070 --> 00:06:06.880
<i>Wow! A bath fit for a king!
I've only dreamt about one like this!</i>

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:15.340
<i>Well, I guess it's safe...</i>

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:21.790
<i>This is the best!</i>

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:27.100
<i>I've always had to scrub my body
with scratchy old towels!</i>

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:35.400
<i>I've turned into a fish!</i>

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:39.270
<i>This feels great!</i>

00:06:41.950 --> 00:06:45.080
<i>My clothes are gone!</i>

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:48.110
<i>Y-you!</i>

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:52.530
Felt great after all that humidity, huh?

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:54.660
<i>Don't tell me that was YOU.</i>

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:56.200
Oopsies!

00:06:56.200 --> 00:07:00.670
I took it upon myself to get rid
of your stinky, sweaty clothes!

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:03.570
You can wear this instead!

00:07:07.970 --> 00:07:10.030
See ya tomorrow!

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:12.680
<i>Get back here, you!</i>

00:07:14.510 --> 00:07:17.450
<i>Yikes! Now it's cold!</i>

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:20.050
<i>It won't open!</i>

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:21.520
<i>I-I need something to wear!</i>

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:28.230
<i>No! That's exactly what he wants!</i>

00:07:33.070 --> 00:07:35.450
<i>It literally is a
demonic air conditioner!</i>

00:07:39.670 --> 00:07:42.140
<i>Why do I hafta wear this swimsuit?!</i>

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:45.130
<i>This sucks so much!</i>

00:07:45.180 --> 00:07:46.190
<i>"Day 4"</i>

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:57.890
Women belong in swimsuits and high-heels,
not tasteless desert suits!

00:07:57.890 --> 00:08:00.990
Yes! That one-piece suit
is better than a bikini!

00:08:00.990 --> 00:08:03.760
And those shiny, red high-heels!

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:06.890
You're beautiful,
Too beautiful, Junko-kun!

00:08:08.100 --> 00:08:10.870
<i>Why am I dressed like this?!</i>

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:15.440
You know...

00:08:15.900 --> 00:08:18.810
I've taken you prisoner
for backstabbing me!

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:22.250
I could hang you if I wanted to.
In other words...

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:30.160
I'm free to enjoy your
presence here any way I wish!

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:33.200
<i>The day of destiny had finally arrived.</i>

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:37.030
Destiny... Yes, the day
of destiny has come!

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:38.640
<i>Destiny?!</i>

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:40.060
Let me prophesize!

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:41.470
Asagiri Junko.

00:08:41.470 --> 00:08:44.490
One year from now, a beautiful baby
that looks just like me

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:46.660
will be suckling at your breast!

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:51.510
<i>Alright.</i>

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:54.550
<i>I'll have your child.</i>

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:57.760
Eh?! Whaaaa...?

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:01.690
That's weird! I expected you
it put up more of a fight!

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:06.660
<i>What can a helpless girl possibly do
in a situation like this?</i>

00:09:06.660 --> 00:09:09.260
<i>I'd have to be stupid
to get myself hurt.</i>

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:12.240
You're quite down-to-earth...

00:09:12.240 --> 00:09:15.360
<i>So what happens once I have your kid?</i>

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:22.420
You raise him, of course!
I'm far too young to be a family man!

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:27.870
Besides, I only care about the process
not the family itself!

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:29.790
I guess you can say it's my calling?

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:36.160
I feel it's the duty of living things
to leave offspring in this world! Yeah!

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:37.760
<i>Okay.</i>

00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:42.400
<i>I'll raise the kid.
He'd only be a burden to you.</i>

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:44.300
Yahoo!

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:50.210
<i>I don't mind. After all,
I'm going to have him kill you anyway.</i>

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:51.680
W-w-what?!

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:54.410
<i>Don't you get it?
It's THE Sunabouzu's kid!</i>

00:09:54.410 --> 00:09:59.700
<i>Wouldn't he grow up to be a violent,
spiteful killing machine</i>

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:02.270
<i>with incredible combat skills?!</i>

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:05.350
<i>Baboo!</i>

00:10:05.350 --> 00:10:08.930
It's me, Daddy! Don't you recognize me?

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:15.080
<i>- Good job, Kanjiro-chan!
- Baboo!</i>

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:16.740
You call yourself a mother?!

00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:19.520
And besides, it was YOUR
backstabbing that started this all!

00:10:19.520 --> 00:10:23.710
<i>Then kill me! That'd be much
better than being your toy!</i>

00:10:23.710 --> 00:10:26.530
Shaddup! Quit bein' a crybaby!

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:32.370
<i>Gotcha!</i>

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:36.620
Crap!

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:39.090
And I knew full well that a crotch-kick

00:10:39.090 --> 00:10:41.810
was the most dangerous thing
in this situation!

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:48.790
<i>You're so easy to manipulate!
Like I'd really ever have your kid!</i>

00:10:50.840 --> 00:10:53.360
<i>How the heck do you undo this lock?!</i>

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:58.200
Only I can open that door.

00:10:58.200 --> 00:10:59.410
<i>Stay away!</i>

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:06.380
I've analyzed you in great detail
and made thorough preparations...

00:11:06.380 --> 00:11:07.790
Give it up.

00:11:07.790 --> 00:11:10.910
Your only choice now is to be my woman!

00:11:10.910 --> 00:11:11.770
<i>No!</i>

00:11:13.590 --> 00:11:15.910
You're such a vivacious woman...

00:11:15.910 --> 00:11:17.370
What the?!

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:21.200
- She really damaged my balls!

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:21.200
<i>- You can just forget about your plan!</i>

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:33.660
<i>No way! You're kidding, right?!
Come on, get up!</i>

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:36.790
<i>You're the only one
who knows how to open this!</i>

00:11:36.790 --> 00:11:39.510
<i>I'm gonna starve to death
if you don't do something!</i>

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:41.630
<i>Get up! Get up! Get up!</i>

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:45.460
<i>Is this how the toughest man
in the Great Kanto Desert dies?!</i>

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:51.160
- Yeah...

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:51.160
<i>- Are you back to life?</i>

00:11:51.160 --> 00:11:54.390
<i>Then go and open the door!</i>

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:58.120
Oh yeah, that's right...

00:11:58.120 --> 00:12:00.440
<i>- Hey, now!</i>

00:11:58.120 --> 00:12:00.440
- I forget how.

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:02.470
<i>- What?!</i>

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:02.470
- By the way...

00:12:02.470 --> 00:12:05.440
Who might you be?

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:09.980
Where are we? Who am I?

00:12:09.980 --> 00:12:11.770
<i>You gotta be kidding me...!</i>

00:12:13.990 --> 00:12:15.470
<i>"Day 5"</i>

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:21.550
<i>- The moron has partial amnesia
from lack of oxygen!</i>

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:21.550
- My head!

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:25.080
<i>Now what?! Do something!</i>

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:29.800
Ah! I remember!

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:31.100
<i>Really?!</i>

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:34.100
We're having kids!

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:37.470
Posterity is the key to everything!

00:12:37.470 --> 00:12:40.610
<i>You idiot! This is no time for that!</i>

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:42.960
<i>Now remember how to unlock the door!</i>

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:51.640
If we make lots and LOTS
of kids, I might regain my memory!

00:13:00.160 --> 00:13:01.120
<i>"Day 6"</i>

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:06.770
- Why, you!

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:06.770
<i>- Whoopsies!</i>

00:13:12.970 --> 00:13:14.890
Gotcha!

00:13:20.310 --> 00:13:24.680
Damn, I never knew high-heels
could be such vicious weapons!

00:13:24.680 --> 00:13:28.420
<i>I'm not wearing them
to make you happy...</i>

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:32.390
<i>If I do escape, I can't exactly
go into the desert barefoot!</i>

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:34.410
Clever...

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:38.800
<i>Did you think I crossed
the desert with only womanly weapons?</i>

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:43.170
Harming my prized captive
won't solve anything...

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:46.060
What do I do?

00:13:46.060 --> 00:13:47.020
<i>"Day 7"</i>

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:56.100
<i>Well? Remember now?</i>

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:57.640
Y-yeah...

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:02.560
<i>Now open it!</i>

00:14:02.560 --> 00:14:04.820
<i>- What?!</i>

00:14:02.560 --> 00:14:04.820
- Um...

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:07.820
It's so complicated
that I can't remember!

00:14:09.060 --> 00:14:11.130
<i>Get serious, you twit!</i>

00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:14.050
<i>How about now?!</i>

00:14:14.050 --> 00:14:15.470
That angle!

00:14:15.470 --> 00:14:18.240
<i>Like this?! Does this angle
help you remember?!</i>

00:14:18.240 --> 00:14:20.310
A little to the right!
Now straight forward!

00:14:21.820 --> 00:14:24.540
<i>You like that?! How's this?!</i>

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:27.820
Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:28.880
<i>"Day 8"</i>

00:14:32.230 --> 00:14:36.190
<i>I'm... going to die here, aren't I?</i>

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:38.260
<i>Trapped in this place...</i>

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:43.050
<i>What a lame way to go!</i>

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:47.430
Should've behaved from the start...

00:14:47.430 --> 00:14:50.340
You wouldn't have used up
so much energy!

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:53.140
<i>Moron! Moron! Moron!</i>

00:14:53.800 --> 00:14:57.480
I bet you're just afraid!

00:14:57.480 --> 00:15:01.210
You're probably pure
and innocent on the inside!

00:15:02.450 --> 00:15:04.780
<i>Grr!</i>

00:15:04.780 --> 00:15:08.920
<i>Look who's talking! It's obvious
that YOU'RE a cherry boy!</i>

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:12.010
<i>You wouldn't know how to handle a woman!</i>

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:14.480
Like hell, I wouldn't!

00:15:14.480 --> 00:15:16.550
I'm umm, yeah!

00:15:16.550 --> 00:15:18.960
Super popular and unstoppable
and mind-blowing!

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:23.050
It's always raring to go and
it's even called the Godly Tool!

00:15:26.310 --> 00:15:30.420
<i>Quit with the horrible lies.
You're pathetic, kido.</i>

00:15:31.420 --> 00:15:35.510
Well, I bet YOU write mushy girly poetry!

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:37.430
<i>So what if I do?!</i>

00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:38.790
No way! You do?!

00:15:42.320 --> 00:15:44.260
All that yelling...

00:15:44.260 --> 00:15:47.190
<i>...wasted even more energy...</i>

00:15:48.790 --> 00:15:51.330
<i>Say...</i>

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:53.970
<i>You had water for the bath...</i>

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:56.440
That was the very last of it...

00:15:56.440 --> 00:15:59.060
<i>And there was an air conditioner...</i>

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:04.560
I used up all the electricity
getting you to put on swimsuit...

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:12.580
<i>"Day 9"</i>

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:17.920
<i>Mommy, I'm hungry!</i>

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:21.320
<i>When it's hot,
colored water hits the spot!</i>

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:29.930
<i>Still, where could Master be?
The Mugenya has some work for him...</i>

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:33.170
<i>Want one?</i>

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:35.380
<i>T-thank you...</i>

00:16:35.380 --> 00:16:36.990
<i>Kanta?!</i>

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:40.310
<i>Nope, ain't seen 'im!
Wouldn't wanna, either!</i>

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:43.650
<i>Somethin' happen to him?</i>

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:50.790
<i>Oh well...</i>

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:53.020
<i>I humbly accept this!</i>

00:16:56.630 --> 00:16:57.720
<i>Yummy!</i>

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:02.720
<i>"Day 10"</i>

00:17:15.350 --> 00:17:17.020
<i>What?</i>

00:17:17.020 --> 00:17:19.590
Come on...

00:17:19.590 --> 00:17:21.780
Just once...

00:17:23.660 --> 00:17:27.990
<i>You really are a
pile of earthly desires...</i>

00:17:29.200 --> 00:17:31.210
I know things look grim...

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:34.800
But I have to satisfy this craving...

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:36.970
I guess I wanna feel it...

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:40.340
I feel like I'm gonna
die any minute now...

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:48.410
So I want to feel... that I'm alive...

00:17:57.220 --> 00:18:00.770
<i>Alright. Fine...</i>

00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:07.000
R-really?!

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:12.370
You... won't hit me?!

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:17.640
That's great! That's great!

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:21.000
<i>But only once!</i>

00:18:22.480 --> 00:18:24.750
Right! Thank you!

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:27.150
<i>But...</i>

00:18:27.150 --> 00:18:30.680
<i>...not because I'm a traitor
or as punishment or anything!</i>

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:35.420
<i>It has to be between a man
and a woman on equal standing!</i>

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:36.500
That's fine with me!

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:38.360
- You got it!

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:38.360
<i>- Put it in writing.</i>

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:42.130
<i>Thank goodness...</i>

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:47.710
<i>Documents always have the final say
here in the Great Kanto Desert...</i>

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:50.440
<i>Now when my body is
discovered decades from now,</i>

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:55.110
<i>I won't be buried as some lowlife!</i>

00:18:58.520 --> 00:19:02.610
Just writing that out has me exhausted...

00:19:03.890 --> 00:19:06.260
<i>Same here...</i>

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:13.270
<i>But... now there'll be no regrets...</i>

00:19:13.270 --> 00:19:18.400
Let's take a break... before we start...

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:20.070
<i>Yeah...</i>

00:19:20.070 --> 00:19:23.770
Good... night...

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:31.860
So warm and squishy!

00:19:31.860 --> 00:19:32.820
<i>"Day 11"</i>

00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:36.220
<i>Master! You're finally awake!</i>

00:19:36.220 --> 00:19:40.080
Posterity! Have my child before I die!

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:41.060
<i>Huh?</i>

00:19:41.060 --> 00:19:46.390
No! Not some flat-chested
brat like you! I want.

00:19:48.970 --> 00:19:51.340
Do I look like an adult now?

00:19:51.340 --> 00:19:53.240
<i>Master!</i>

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:56.510
Where am I?!

00:19:56.510 --> 00:19:58.790
<i>The town clinic.</i>

00:19:58.790 --> 00:20:01.160
Wait, is my kid being born?!

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:01.970
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:04.340
Guess what! I've already chosen a name!

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:08.530
His name'll be Kanjiro!
He'll go, "Baboo!"

00:20:08.530 --> 00:20:10.360
<i>Will you get serious?!</i>

00:20:10.360 --> 00:20:13.060
<i>What in the world
are you talking about?!</i>

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:13.860
Huh?!

00:20:13.860 --> 00:20:16.560
<i>Things got really bad, you know!</i>

00:20:16.560 --> 00:20:20.090
<i>What, was it a difficult birth?</i>

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:24.160
Oh, yea! I was at my secret base and.

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:28.400
Hey! How did you know
about my secret base?!

00:20:29.780 --> 00:20:35.610
<i>I saw you sneaking around with
a shovel and cement a while back!</i>

00:20:35.610 --> 00:20:38.880
You... trailed me?!

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:43.060
<i>That's the only reason
you're alive now!</i>

00:20:43.060 --> 00:20:46.630
<i>Some work had come in,
but I couldn't find you anywhere,</i>

00:20:46.630 --> 00:20:50.160
<i>so I thought you might be there,
but the door wouldn’t open,</i>

00:20:50.160 --> 00:20:55.000
<i>so I finally had the
Kawaguchi brothers break it down.</i>

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:56.700
<i>And then...</i>

00:20:57.570 --> 00:21:00.970
<i>...we found you all shriveled up
and lying next to that woman.</i>

00:21:00.970 --> 00:21:04.980
Yeah! What happened to her?!
Where's Asagiri Junko?!

00:21:04.980 --> 00:21:06.910
<i>She left yesterday.</i>

00:21:09.050 --> 00:21:10.580
You let her go?!

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:12.820
<i>What was I supposed to do?!</i>

00:21:12.820 --> 00:21:16.860
<i>She had a form saying you
forgave her of all her crimes!</i>

00:21:16.860 --> 00:21:17.660
Eh?

00:21:17.660 --> 00:21:19.060
Eh?

00:21:26.630 --> 00:21:28.730
<i>Catching and holding
a woman for days on end</i>

00:21:28.730 --> 00:21:30.570
<i>and then just letting her go...</i>

00:21:30.570 --> 00:21:33.630
<i>That's really pathetic!</i>

00:21:34.840 --> 00:21:38.340
What the hell was I doing?!

00:21:38.340 --> 00:21:43.450
<i>Check it out, Bro!
There's weapons and ammo back here!</i>

00:21:43.450 --> 00:21:47.790
<i>We're all alive!</i>

00:21:43.450 --> 00:21:44.680
<i>- This bathtub looks brand new!</i>

00:21:44.680 --> 00:21:48.550
<i>- We can buy food if we sell this!</i>

00:21:47.790 --> 00:21:50.720
<i>We sing because we're alive!</i>

00:21:48.550 --> 00:21:50.720
<i>- Honey!</i>

00:21:50.720 --> 00:21:54.430
<i>We're all alive!</i>

00:21:50.720 --> 00:21:54.430
<i>- I'm hungry!
- Here, take it!</i>

00:21:54.430 --> 00:21:57.760
<i>We're sad because we're alive!</i>

00:21:54.430 --> 00:21:57.760
<i>- Thank you!</i>

00:21:57.760 --> 00:22:07.290
<i>When I hold my palm up to the sun,
my blood flows through bright red!</i>

00:22:07.290 --> 00:22:10.000
<i>My blood flows through bright red!</i>

00:22:07.290 --> 00:22:09.400
- My dream for future posterity!

00:22:10.440 --> 00:22:11.840
<i>The worms</i>

00:22:11.840 --> 00:22:14.050
<i>and the mole crickets</i>

00:22:14.050 --> 00:22:17.580
<i>and the water strider</i>

00:22:17.580 --> 00:22:20.590
<i>- Stop it, Master!</i>

00:22:17.580 --> 00:22:20.590
<i>are all alive!</i>

00:22:20.590 --> 00:22:23.900
<i>We're all friends!</i>

00:22:23.900 --> 00:22:24.720
<i>JAN!</i>

00:23:55.950 --> 00:23:57.790
<i>Yo... Ghost of the Desert, Sunabo...</i>

00:23:57.790 --> 00:24:00.250
<i>M-my boobies! I worked so hard for.</i>

00:24:00.250 --> 00:24:03.390
<i>Umm, I'm sorry you had to hear that.</i>

00:24:03.390 --> 00:24:06.390
<i>On the next episode-
"Little Girl and Rescue"</i>

00:24:06.390 --> 00:24:10.450
<i>- Little girls don't have boobies either!
- Miss it and it's flat chests for you!</i>
